# Rendered output from the tools/ui_preview.gd HUD preview harness.
ui_preview_out/

# FlatBuffers envelopes written by `cargo xtask decode-fixture`, consumed by the headless decode
# guards. NOT committed: they are a pure function of the Rust source, and `cargo xtask decode-guard`
# regenerates them before every run, so a committed copy is never the copy under test — it can only
# go stale or collide. Binary, so git cannot merge one; the golden they are diffed against
# (tests/golden/snapshot_dict.json) IS committed, because that is the assertion rather than the input.
tests/fixtures/*.bin

# Written and removed by scripts/preview.sh for the duration of a render-harness run, so the
# harness window does not take the keyboard. Never committed: it would boot the GAME windowed
# and unfocusable.
override.cfg
